  "verification": "Reference implementation: reference/topology/remote-node-hint.ts — createRemoteNodeHint, hintToHex, verifyRemoteNodeHint.",
  "notes": "The signature mutation, expired-timestamp mutation, and hop-overflow mutation are constructed by spreading a genuine RemoteNodeHint and overriding a single field. The brand is preserved so verifyRemoteNodeHint still treats the mutated object as a RemoteNodeHint — this exercises the runtime verification path, not the constructor's input validation."
